        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand as the last bastion against the apocalypse in <strong>Ice Core Tower Defense</strong>! You are humanity's final hope—a mighty ice tower positioned at the heart of a world under siege. Endless waves of malevolent magma circles pour forth from the depths, their molten fury threatening to consume everything you hold dear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of elemental warfare as you unleash devastating frost attacks upon your enemies. Choose your strategy: engage auto-fire mode for relentless, calculated precision, or take manual control for intense, skill-based combat where every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power grows with every battle won. Dive into a massive skill tree featuring over 600 upgrade nodes, each offering unique enhancements to transform your tower into an unstoppable force of nature. Unlock devastating special abilities that turn the tide of war—harness <strong>Chain Lightning</strong> to arc between multiple enemies, or detonate bone-chilling <strong>Area Frost Explosions</strong> that freeze entire waves in their tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the world rests in your icy grip. Will you rise as the eternal guardian, or will the magma circles reduce everything to ash and ember?</p>",
